Voice Relay
Copyright 2026 lperezmo

This product is a modified version of Phone Whisper
(https://github.com/kafkasl/phone-whisper), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The original commit history is preserved in this
repository.

Changes from upstream include: a new application id and package
(com.lperezmo.voicerelay), release signing, updated Android SDK and build
tooling, removal of on-device speech recognition, an on-device wake word, and
subsequent changes recorded in the git history.

The wake word uses sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx): its
Kotlin bindings are vendored under app/src/main/kotlin/com/k2fsa/sherpa/onnx/,
its Android native library, which statically links ONNX Runtime
(https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime), is built from source with only its
keyword-spotting parts by scripts/build_sherpa.sh in CI, and the
sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-zh-en-3M-2025-12-20 keyword-spotting model is
downloaded at build time by scripts/fetch_sherpa.sh. Both are bundled in the
APK. sherpa-onnx is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; ONNX
Runtime under the MIT License.

THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists all third-party software included in the app, with
its license, version and source, and the licenses/ folder holds the full license
texts that are not reproduced there. The app shows the same files under
Settings > About > Open-source licenses.
